cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software or the views and analysis it produces, please cite
  it as below. The bundled datasets keep their own licences and must be cited
  to their original publishers (see the references below and the /data page).
title: "Global Energy Map"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-09
authors:
  - family-names: Nag
    given-names: Narendra
repository-code: "https://github.com/narendranag/global-energy-map"
url: "https://global-energy-map-one.vercel.app"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  An interactive OSINT visualization of the world's hydrocarbon energy
  system — reserves, extraction, transport, refining, and distribution —
  built for academics, energy-policy researchers, and IR/economics
  scholars who think in systems.
